description:
src/app/api/webhooks/stripe/route.ts handleCheckoutCompleted() fires on every checkout.session.completed event without checking session.payment_status. Failed or cancelled checkouts could trigger Pro upgrades in edge cases (e.g., async-payment flows, manual refunds).

Fix:

  if (session.payment_status !== 'paid') {
    console.log('[stripe-webhook] checkout completed but not paid');
    return;
  }

Place the guard at the top of handleCheckoutCompleted, before any DB writes or tier transitions.

Severity: HIGH — financial / authorization (free Pro).
